OL,3,ALife-threatening Hurricane Isaias makes
OL,4,Alandfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FHurricane Isaias has made landfall in
OL,7,Fthe US state of Florida and is expected
OL,8,Fto bring life-threatening flooding and
OL,9,Fwinds that have forced thousands to
OL,10,Fevacuate.
OL,12,FThe storm weakened slightly to a
OL,13,Fcategory 2 hurricane, with 110 mph (175
OL,14,Fkph) winds, before ramming into
OL,15,FFlorida's western panhandle on Friday
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
