OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALife-threatening Hurricane Isaias makes
OL,4,Alandfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlorida, Alabama, and Georgia have each
OL,7,Fissued states of emergency as
OL,8,Fmeteorologists warned of
OL,9,Flife-threatening storm surge that could
OL,10,Fcause up to 9 feet (2.7m) of flooding
OL,11,Fin some areas.
OL,13,FIsaias is one of three storm systems
OL,14,Faffecting North America this weekend,
OL,15,Fwith the two others hitting Mexico and
OL,16,FSouthern California in the El-Nino
OL,17,Ffuelled warm waters of the Pacific
OL,18,FOcean.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
